msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Surviving's tough, but chatting helps.  How are you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Tell me about your last adventure."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's a goal you're working towards?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's been your biggest challenge recently?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's the latest, <name_g>?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's the strangest thing you've encountered?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You got a story to share?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think the military's still out there somewhere?  Holed up, planning a "
"comeback?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think the oceans are safe?  Or is there stuff down there now, too?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still radio stations out there, broadcasting to no "
"one?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still secret labs out there, doing god knows what?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's a place where people have rebuilt?  Like, a hidden "
"utopia?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's any hope left?  Or are we just clinging to a lost cause?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's anyone out there who knows the full story?  Someone with"
" all the answers?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever find a place where we can just… be safe?  Truly safe?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever have a moment of peace?  Just one day where we don't "
"have to worry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Do you think we'll ever rebuild?  Like, really rebuild?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever see a world without fear again?  A place where kids "
"can play outside?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever understand the full extent of what happened?  All the"
" whys and hows?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever hear about those places that supposedly have a natural immunity to the "
"virus?  Wonder if they're real."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how future generations will look at us?  If there even are "
"future generations."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how the animals are coping with all this?  Mutants are one "
"thing, but what about the regular ones?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how weird it is that we're still here, fighting to survive?"
"  Like, why us?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ever think about what you'd do differently if you knew this was coming?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if the animals have it better than us now?  Less to worry about, "
"just surviving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if the plants and trees know what's happening?  If they feel it "
"too?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if there are places out there that haven't been touched by all "
"this?  Little pockets of normality?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if we're just in some kind of experiment?  Like, some twisted lab"
" rat scenario?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't help but think there's more to this than we know.  Like, some big "
"secret waiting to be uncovered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't shake the feeling that someone's watching us.  Like, we're not alone "
"in this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop thinking about those conspiracy theories.  Aliens, government "
"experiments gone wrong…what if some of it's true?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I heard a story about a place where the dead don't rise.  Sounds too good to "
"be true, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss the little things, like traffic jams and crowded malls.  Never thought"
" I'd say that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss the simple things.  Like a hot shower.  Think we'll ever have that "
"again?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I miss the taste of fresh food.  Think we'll ever have that again?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I sometimes think about all the places I wanted to visit.  Wonder what "
"they're like now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I sometimes wonder if it's better to not know the full truth about what "
"caused all this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I used to be scared of the dark.  Now it's the least of my worries."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I used to dream about adventures.  This… this isn't what I had in mind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to think the apocalypse would be more… glamorous, you know?  Less "
"dirt, more Mad Max."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to think the end of the world would bring people together.  Guess I "
"was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I used to think the world was big.  Now it feels so small, so fragile."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if there are other dimensions where things didn't go to hell.  "
"Parallel worlds where everything's fine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if we'll ever see real civilization again, or if this is just the "
"new normal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about entire towns just vanishing overnight.  No bodies, no"
" signs of struggle.  Creepy, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've heard whispers about groups out there, still trying to control things.  "
"Like some shadow government or something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "People used to laugh at preppers.  Who's laughing now, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember those stories about underground cities?  Wonder if anyone's living "
"down there now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember when people thought the internet would last forever?  Feels like a "
"joke now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Some say the world ending was nature's way of hitting the reset button.  What"
" do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I think about those survivalist nutjobs.  Bet they're having the "
"last laugh now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the stars look different now.  Like, did they change "
"too?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the world ended for a reason.  Like, maybe we needed a "
"reset."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if this is all some sort of punishment.  But for what, who"
" knows?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if this is some kind of test.  Like, we're being judged on"
" how we handle it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're just delaying the inevitable.  Like, what's the "
"point?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's so much we don't know about what caused this.  You think we'll ever "
"get answers?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Think any famous people made it through all this?  Celebrities hiding out "
"somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you think happened to all the rich and powerful?  Think they had a "
"plan for this?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if the cause of all this is still out there, waiting to finish the job?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if there are survivors out there who have no idea what happened?  "
"Completely cut off from everything."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole time before <the_cataclysm> was just a dream "
"you're waking up from?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole world is just… tired?  Like it's ready to give "
"up?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You ever feel like the whole world is one big haunted house now?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever hear about that weird cult that was stockpiling supplies?  Bet "
"they're feeling pretty smug now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever hear about those secret bunkers?  Bet they're laughing at us from "
"their safe havens."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the tech we lost?  I mean, we were so close to AI, "
"now we're just scraping by."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the things we took for granted?  Running water, "
"electricity, safety."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think we'll see the sun rise on a world that's not falling apart?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder if the scientists who caused this are still out there, hiding"
" somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think any of those doomsday bunkers actually worked?  Might be folks "
"underground right now, clueless about what's happened."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think there are any places left untouched by all this?  Like, some hidden"
" paradise?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think there are still places where people live normal lives?  Kids going "
"to school, adults going to work?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think there's a chance this was all just one big mistake?  Some accident "
"that spiraled out of control?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think those sci-fi movies got anything right about how this would go "
"down?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever find a cure for the zombification?  Or is this it for "
"humanity?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever find a way to make sense of all this?  Or are we just "
"stumbling in the dark?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever get to a point where we can relax again?  Not just "
"survive, but live?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever hear music again?  Real music, not just the sound of our"
" own fears?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be more
#. about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever laugh again?  Like, really laugh, without any fear or "
"worry?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think any of the old world leaders survived?  If they did, what would "
"they be doing now?  Hiding, trying to rebuild, or something else entirely?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever notice how some people seem almost unaffected mentally?  Like they're "
"perfectly adjusted to this new world.  Makes you wonder if they knew more "
"than they let on before everything went to hell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how some people seem to thrive in this chaos?  It's almost "
"like they were made for it.  Makes you wonder what they were like before "
"everything went to hell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Have you noticed how some zombies seem to be smarter than others?  It's like "
"there's a hierarchy among them, but that shouldn't be possible, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't shake the feeling that this was all planned.  Not the outbreak "
"itself, but the way it spread so quickly and efficiently."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop wondering who fucked up to make all this happen.  Obviously we "
"can't trust the news, they claimed the zombies were 'rioters' for weeks.  "
"Why?  Where did this come from?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep seeing these weird symbols in old buildings.  They look ancient, but "
"they're in places they shouldn't be.  Makes you wonder if someone was "
"preparing for this long before it happened."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep thinking about how fast society collapsed.  It was almost as if "
"something was waiting for the perfect moment to strike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I read somewhere that human behavior changes in the presence of certain "
"frequencies.  What if someone was broadcasting those right before the "
"Cataclysm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to think the world was big and complicated.  Now it feels like all the"
" complexity was just a facade, and the real rules of the game were hidden "
"from us."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about the old myths and legends.  Zombies, monsters, the "
"end of the world… what if those stories were based on something real, "
"something that happened before?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about those old sci-fi movies where they talked about "
"alternate dimensions and parallel universes.  Maybe what happened here is "
"connected to something like that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've noticed the stars look different lately.  Maybe it's just me, but I "
"swear there are constellations I've never seen before."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Is it just me, or does it feel like we're being watched sometimes?  Not just "
"by other survivors, but something else, something more… omnipresent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're not alone in this.  Not just other survivors, but"
" something bigger, observing us, maybe even experimenting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"The idea that this is all some kind of massive reset, a way for the Earth to "
"cleanse itself of us, keeps nagging at me.  What if it's true?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"The more I see of this new world, the more I think we're missing some big "
"piece of the puzzle.  There's something out there we haven't figured out yet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"The way plants have started growing in some areas, almost aggressively… it's "
"like nature is trying to take back control in a hurry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be more to the story about those 'safe zones' the government "
"talked about.  Why did they stop broadcasting?  What happened to them?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's something off about the way animals are mutating.  It's like they're "
"evolving at an accelerated pace, but not randomly.  There seems to be some "
"kind of pattern."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if the government knew this was coming and just didn't tell us?  Maybe "
"they thought they could control it and failed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder if there's a cure out there, somewhere?  Not just for the "
"zombies, but for everything that's happened to the world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why some people went feral and others didn't?  There has to "
"be more to it than just stress and fear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think all those conspiracy theorists were onto something?  The ones "
"talking about secret experiments and shadow governments?  It's starting to "
"look less crazy now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs' perspective
#. on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think the Earth itself is reacting to all this?  Like, on a geological "
"level?  Earthquakes, weather patterns, everything seems more intense."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think any of those doomsday preppers made it?  Bet they're feeling "
"pretty smug right about now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still places untouched by all this?  Like some remote "
"island or hidden valley where people are just living normal lives?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever get back to a point where we can have holidays again?"
"  Celebrating seems like a distant dream."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how lucky we are to have found each other?  In a world this "
"messed up, having friends is everything."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how quiet it is now?  No cars, no planes, just the wind and "
"the groans of the dead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss fresh fruit.  There's something about biting into a juicy apple that "
"canned stuff just can't replicate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss music.  Remember concerts?  The energy of the crowd, the live sound.  "
"Wonder if any musicians survived."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss the little things.  Like the smell of fresh bread, or the sound of a "
"coffee machine in the morning."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd miss doing laundry.  Wearing the same clothes day after "
"day gets old fast."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to complain about going to work.  Now I'd give anything for a boring "
"day at the office."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to hate bugs, but now I see them as a sign of life.  Weird how "
"perspective changes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I was never much of a cook before, but now I can make a mean stew out of "
"almost anything.  Survival skills, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if anyone's tried to start a farm again.  Gotta be tough with all "
"the zombies, but food doesn't grow on trees."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if kids born after all this will even understand what the world used"
" to be like.  Seems like a fairytale now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if the power will ever come back on.  Can't imagine how much stuff "
"we took for granted before all this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's funny, I never appreciated the sunrise as much as I do now.  Every day "
"we're still here feels like a gift."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's funny, I used to hate the rain.  Now it's like a blessing, makes "
"everything feel a bit cleaner."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's strange how some buildings are completely untouched, like time just "
"stopped in them.  Then you go next door, and it's a total wreck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's strange how the stars seem brighter now without all the city lights.  "
"Almost beautiful, if it weren't so damn scary."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's weird to think about all the things we used to stress over.  Traffic, "
"bills, deadlines.  None of that seems to matter now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder what the future will look like.  Will we rebuild, or is "
"this just how it is now?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Think we'll ever figure out what really caused all this?  Sometimes I feel "
"like knowing would just make it worse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the pets that were left behind?  Poor things didn't "
"ask for this any more than we did."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about space?  I mean, what's happening up there?  Are "
"astronauts just floating around, not knowing what happened down here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about what the first thing you'll do if things ever get back "
"to normal?  I think I'd just sit in a park and watch the world go by."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think animals sense the zombies differently than we do?  They always seem"
" to know when something's off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Could be.  What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ever considered…?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Good observation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Got any more thoughts on that?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I can relate to that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I can see where you're coming from."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "I know what you mean."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I never thought of it that way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Interesting.  What else?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I've been pondering that too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I was just thinking about that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Now that you mention it…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Tell me more about that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That's a good point."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That's an interesting take."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That's a solid perspective."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That's one way to look at it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "That's pretty insightful."
